      "writtenOn": "2021-10-19T10:31:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While you\u0027re here, can we be more specific / simple and say:\n\nreceivedTime time according to {@link android.os.SystemClock#elapsedRealtime()} /  when the framework received the NITZ time from the RIL\n\n(I\u0027ve reversed the wording about whether it\u0027s the time it was received, not the time it was sent, but not sure which way is correct, so please adjust accordingly).\n\nThis avoids somebody changing to use some other clock that claims to track the same thing but doesn\u0027t, and would be a source of error. Timing / ordering / ageing only works if everybody agrees on the clock / timebase to be used.",
