      "writtenOn": "2021-10-21T09:35:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Add check for ageMs in patchset 14.\nIn normal cases, the value of ageMs should be greater then 0 and less then receivedTimeMs.\nSo if the ageMs value is negative or greater than receivedTimeMs, ignore the NITZ.",
      "parentUuid": "81ffdccc_60c3deb4",
